+  // carry lookaheads, and the fuzzer is the part these settings could blind.
+  // This source is one this library really generates: two parameters joined
+  // by a repeated-character separator are ambiguous, since a parameter may
+  // absorb the separator, and no rewrite of it is both safe and unchanged in
