+ * `end`, `trailing` and `sensitive` had no gate here: each of them changes the
+ * emitted source, and a delimiter of `--` changes what the negated character
+ * classes contain. This matrix pairs the shapes that put two repeatable
+ * constructs either side of a repeated-character separator - the arrangement
+ * every unsafe verdict this project has seen came from - with each option that
+ * rewrites those sources.
+ */
